# 行尾规范（实机教训：Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 时 git archive 也会转换，
# 镜像里的 shell 脚本带上  直接导致容器起不来）
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.db binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
